  "body": "The post-merge batch gate failed on `211105042b817a5b32fdf2c971d42e6d968297c6`.\n\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/44848736023\n\nFailing steps:\n```\n  FAIL     1s  app suites: default_machine_missing  failed: tests/default_machine_missing.rs [tests: a_missing_default_machine_file_refuses_the_post_per_operation]\n```\n\nThe merge that broke it is among the commits up to this head (`git log` since the last green run). Fix it in the normal order; this issue closes itself on the next green run.",
